CHORDS FINDER APPLICATION DESCRIPTION

1. Overview
-----------
Chords Finder is a web application that analyzes MP3 files to detect and display chord progressions along with audio visualization. The application provides an intuitive interface for musicians and music enthusiasts to understand the harmonic structure of their music.

2. Technical Stack
-----------------
Backend:
- Flask (Python web framework)
- Madmom (Music signal processing library for chord detection)
- Librosa (Audio processing support)

Frontend:
- HTML5/CSS3
- JavaScript
- Wavesurfer.js (Audio waveform visualization)
- Bootstrap (Responsive design framework)

